          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The outer frame is the Studio window; the inner frame is the visualization. In Fixed size mode the visualization keeps its own size when the window grows, which can look like an empty border around the graphic. Use Fill window to draw edge to edge.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外框是 Studio 窗口，内框是可视化区域。在“固定大小”模式下，窗口变大时可视化区域保持自身大小，图形周围可能出现空白边框。使用“填满窗口”可让图形铺满边缘。"
