    "Window and visualization options apply the next time Audune launches. Launch at login takes effect for the next macOS login. Changing these here does not alter the current session’s open windows.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口与可视化选项将在下次启动 Audune 时生效。登录时启动会在下次登录 macOS 时生效。在此修改不会改变当前会话已打开的窗口。"
